  "body": "Absolute beachfront opportunities in Orewa are exceptionally rare. Beachfront with Town Centre zoning is even harder to secure.\r\n\r\nPositioned directly above the golden sands of Orewa Beach, this beautifully renovated coastal retreat offers an enviable lifestyle today, while presenting exciting future possibilities for generations to come.\r\n\r\nWake to uninterrupted sea views, step from your lawn onto the beach, and enjoy everything that makes Orewa one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal destinations. Whether it's an early morning swim, paddleboard at sunrise, or a leisurely stroll to one of the many cafés and restaurants nearby, this is beachfront living at its most effortless.\r\n\r\nThe home itself has been thoughtfully renovated, creating a relaxed, modern environment that is ready to be enjoyed immediately. Light-filled interiors frame the stunning coastal outlook, while the easy-care nature of the property makes it an ideal permanent residence, holiday home, lock-and-leave retreat, or investment.\r\n\r\nWhat truly sets this property apart is its Town Centre zoning under the Auckland Unitary Plan. This unique designation provides flexibility rarely found in such a tightly held beachfront location, allowing future owners to explore residential, commercial, accommodation, or mixed-use opportunities, subject to council requirements.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking a family beach house, this is a place to create lasting memories. For investors and visionaries, it is a strategic landholding in the heart of a thriving coastal township. For business owners, it presents the possibility of combining lifestyle and enterprise in one of Orewa's most prominent beachfront positions.\r\n\r\nWith the beach at your doorstep and Orewa's vibrant town centre outside your gate, this is a property that delivers on lifestyle, location, and long-term potential.\r\n\r\nBeachfront. Town Centre Zoned. Future Focused.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a landmark position on one of Auckland's most treasured coastlines.\r\nContact Leanne Wallace and Cushla Fell at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.",
